&lt;section class=&quot;block you-do&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;The stupid...&lt;/h4&gt;
	&lt;div class=&quot;blob&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;blob-title&quot;&gt;
        Idiot-in-chief signs an executive order to rename Lake Ontario to Lake America &lt;a href=&quot;https://apnews.com/article/lake-ontario-canada-america-trump-trade-war-3ac58dca0ca83c15605d4dbff146b28a&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;[Link&lt;span class=&quot;bi bi-link-45deg&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;]&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;blob-content&quot;&gt;
        &lt;div class=&quot;image-right&quot; style=&quot;width:225px&quot;&gt;

    &lt;a href=&quot;/images/2qlsQ-2LCP-800.webp&quot; class=&quot;lightbox-link&quot; aria-haspopup=&quot;dialog&quot; style=&quot;cursor:zoom-in&quot;&gt;
      &lt;img class=&quot;img-lightbox&quot; alt=&quot;Map of Lake Ontario&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; style=&quot;--img-width:200&quot; src=&quot;/images/2qlsQ-2LCP-200.webp&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; height=&quot;528&quot; srcset=&quot;/images/2qlsQ-2LCP-200.webp 200w, /images/2qlsQ-2LCP-800.webp 800w&quot; sizes=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;
    &lt;/a&gt;

            &lt;p class=&quot;caption&quot;&gt;Map of Lake Ontario, c. 1817.&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;Right after launching a new trade war with Canada, Donny 2-Dolls makes an attempt to add insult to injury by signing an executive order to rename Lake Ontario to Lake America.&lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;The president apparently forgot to read what he signed, because the order was for the change to be made within 30 days, but he told reporters it was &quot;effective immediately.&quot; He&#39;s also hinting that he plans to similarly rename either the Atlantic Ocean or the Pacific Ocean in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;Lake Ontario has borne its name for over 400 years, long before the United States of America was even an idea. The name is Huron for &quot;Lake of shining waters,&quot; which makes a lot more sense than &quot;Lake America.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;div&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;related-links&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Related Links:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;ul class=&quot;related-links&quot;&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://apnews.com/article/lake-ontario-canada-america-trump-trade-war-3ac58dca0ca83c15605d4dbff146b28a&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;(AP) Trump signs order renaming Lake Ontario as &quot;Lake America&quot; in the United States&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;/ul&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
	&lt;/div&gt;
