    &lt;p&gt;Recap of this week in the revolution: Lying Leavitt will leave the White House. Trump orders Navy to replace modern equipment with outdated systems and mandates a vaccine schedule that contradicts science. ICE agents to be equipped with electric shock gloves.&lt;/p&gt;
