	&lt;div class=&quot;blob&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;blob-title&quot;&gt;
        Russell Vought has become the shadow president &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.propublica.org/article/russ-vought-trump-shadow-president-omb&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;[Link&lt;span class=&quot;bi bi-link-45deg&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;]&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;blob-content&quot;&gt;
        &lt;div class=&quot;image-right&quot; style=&quot;width:225px&quot;&gt;

    &lt;a href=&quot;/images/klAqWvjtj5-800.webp&quot; class=&quot;lightbox-link&quot; aria-haspopup=&quot;dialog&quot; style=&quot;cursor:zoom-in&quot;&gt;
      &lt;img class=&quot;img-lightbox&quot; alt=&quot;Russell Vought&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; style=&quot;--img-width:200&quot; src=&quot;/images/klAqWvjtj5-200.webp&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; height=&quot;1067&quot; srcset=&quot;/images/klAqWvjtj5-200.webp 200w, /images/klAqWvjtj5-800.webp 800w&quot; sizes=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;
    &lt;/a&gt;

            &lt;p class=&quot;caption&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Russell Vought.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;Russell Vought is the director of the White House Office of Management and Budget (OMB), an agency that traditionally holds a lot of power in the government. It establishes policies for all federal employees and controls the disbursement of all funds appropriated by Congress.&lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;But Vought is taking that power to a whole new level, using the power of his position to base all government action on carrying out the Trump&#39;s personal agenda without even pretending to care about what&#39;s best for the country. It was Vought who redirected funding from the Defense Department to build Trump&#39;s border wall and pressured Ukraine to investigate Joe Biden&#39;s son, Hunter, during Biden&#39;s 2020 campaign. He spent the four years of the Biden administration planning out what would happen if Trump was re-elected in 2024. When Trump took office in 2025, Vought directed the entire executive branch of government to slash all foreign assistance, push the limits of presidential power to new extremes, refused to spend Congressionally-appropriated money, fired tens of thousands of federal employees, and abandoned all government DEI programs.&lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;blockquote&gt;
			&lt;p&gt;We work for the President of the United States...[but] it feels like we work for Russ Vought. He has centralized decision-­making power to an extent that he is the commander in chief.&lt;/p&gt;
			&lt;figcaption class=&quot;blockquote-footer&quot;&gt;Unnamed senior agency official&lt;/figcaption&gt;
		&lt;/blockquote&gt;
        &lt;div&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;related-links&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Related Links:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;ul class=&quot;related-links&quot;&gt;
                &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.propublica.org/article/russ-vought-trump-shadow-president-omb&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;(ProPublica) The shadow president&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;/ul&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
	&lt;/div&gt;
