		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://apnews.com/article/iran-us-israel-war-oil-july-8-2026-fee04dcea661c08de12c04914ff2751b&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Trump declares Iran ceasefire over as U.S. strikes Iran and threatens additional attacks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;	
